# The pin (.harness/PIN) hashes file content, and `normalise` in harness/verify_pin.py folds
# CRLF to LF so a Windows checkout cannot trip it. This file is the other half: keep the working
# tree itself identical on every platform, so a diff, a gate log and a review package all read
# the same wherever they were produced.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact by nature.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary

# Fixtures are compared verbatim; never let git touch them.
tests/fixtures/** -text
